      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I dont have much input as I solved this problem quite some time ago, but what fixed this for me was switching my Z690 motherboard out to upgrade to an X670E to run my 7950x3d. Before this upgrade I tried different memory and cpus in the Z690 board and nothing remedied the problem until I completely changed chipsets.",
