      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hello everyone!\n\nSo this was an issue I had very recently, and people have changed their motherboards to fix the issue, if this happens to you there’s a reasonable chance that removing the “CMOS” battery from your motherboard for a few mins then placing it back will also fix this potentially, it fixed the issue for me :)\n\nJust before you do this please look up a short guide on doing this and what this changes so you’re prepared to get back to being buttery smooth on VRChat once more ^w^",
